# due-total and each person's due-total in it as they are now (the figures of the claims that count dated in it, skipping n/a); later rate
# changes do not alter it. Refused (400) when the sheet's permission matrix (perm-close; by default a
# clerk or a steward) does not allow the user's role, when the period is not on the sheet or is already closed;
